+# RelateAnything GGML integration
+
+This marker is applied by the parent project's CMake configure step.
+The integration uses GGML's public backend, graph, and GGUF APIs and keeps
+model-specific code in `cpp_ggml`; no cuDNN dependency is introduced.
+The patch is intentionally small so a clean GGML v0.21.0 checkout can replay
+it deterministically.
